---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About" description={`About ${AUTHOR}, and why this blog exists.`} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article>
				<h1>About</h1>
				<p>
					I'm Ben Verbeken. I write software, and like everyone else I lately mostly direct agents that write it
					for me.
				</p>
				<p>
					In 2014 I co-founded <a href="https://seats.io">seats.io</a>, a seating chart and reserved
					seating platform for ticketing companies. I still spend most of my time there: designing,
					reviewing, and cleaning up after Claude.
				</p>
				<p>
					This blog is where I document how my work is changing while it happens. Experiments,
					workflows, what works and what doesn't. Mostly for myself, partly for other developers
					going through the same thing, and a little bit for future agents.
				</p>
				<p>
					I live in Belgium with my family. Away from the keyboard I sing in <a
						href="https://captainsugar.be/">Captain Sugar &amp; The Daddies</a
					> and go <a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/63708615">running</a>.
				</p>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
